<title>UK: YPF sets 300 billion lire five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>YPF sets 300 billion lire five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Chase and Banca Commerciale Italiano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   YPF</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     8.75	MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.975   PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.70     SPREAD	+209 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (M) 5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
